@startuml
title User Management Module : Reset Password

actor "Traveller / Tourism Operator" as Actor
participant UI as ":resetPassword"
participant Ctrl as ":userController"
participant Auth as ":firebaseAuthentication"

Actor -> UI: Select Reset Password
UI --> Actor: Display reset password form
Actor -> UI: Enter registered email address
Actor -> UI: Submit password reset request
UI -> Ctrl: Submit registered email address
Ctrl -> Ctrl: validateEmailAddress()

alt [Email input is invalid]
    Ctrl --> UI: Display email validation error
    UI --> Actor: Request a valid email address
else [Email input is valid]
    Ctrl -> Auth: sendPasswordResetEmail(email)
    Auth --> Ctrl: Password reset request result

    alt [Reset email is sent]
        Ctrl --> UI: Display reset email sent message
    else [Email is not registered]
        Ctrl --> UI: Display email not found message
    else [Too many reset requests]
        Ctrl --> UI: Display try again later message
    else [Firebase Authentication fails]
        Ctrl --> UI: Display unable to send reset email message
    end
end
@enduml
